# .atlas.conf — the only per-repo Atlas configuration.
# Sourced by scripts/atlas-*.sh, which are otherwise byte-identical in every
# component repo so they can be checksum-verified against the method templates.
SLUG="<slug>"
ATLAS_VAULT_REMOTE="https://github.com/<org>/Atlas-<Project>.git"

# Optional overrides — defaults shown.
# ATLAS_VAULT=.atlas
# ATLAS_METHOD=.atlas-method
# ATLAS_METHOD_REMOTE=https://github.com/OneMoreRabbit/Atlas.git
#
# Desk layout: ATLAS_VAULT may point at an existing checkout instead of a clone.
# On Windows, spell it the way your tools report paths (e.g. G:/Projects/Atlas-X,
# forward slashes) so the write guard's path match agrees with hook payloads.
